		"description": {
			"value": "<p>Whether by birth, ritual, or accident, you are infused with powers from the &amp;reference[elemental] plane of air. Magic comes to you easily, and you have greater control over elemental air than any other.</p><table><caption>Air Savant</caption><colgroup><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Level</th><th scope=\"col\">Features</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Empowered Cantrips: <em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.MCkk4j7jTPlTmguW]{Lapidate}</em>, <em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.bMieP6ykkdm9Vp1x]{Static Charge}</em></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.1BFutndu3YZJ8aGD]{Volatile Current}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.oHDTxrRzAHJFYd5y]{&amp;reference[elemental] Infusion}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.WkYuAfddu7WT6O5u]{Ascendant Air}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.7osHeNgdVZKXuuno]{Air &amp;reference[elemental] Form}</td></tr></tbody></table><table><caption>Expanded Spell List</caption><colgroup><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Sorcerer Level</th><th scope=\"col\">Extra Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.6wwdUiIlvMcAf3NG]{Ball Lightning}</em></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.G1qQZd6IkSfweHlE]{Gust of Wind}</em></td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.xf2o9rcYvoN4NVgn]{Wind Wall}</em></td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.OcQuaCu8X1C6TD4D]{Lashing Wind}</em></td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.zI81EiDs2vyozitg]{Vortex}</em></td></tr></tbody></table>",
