				"level": 6,
				"title": "Auran Speech",
				"hint": "You learn the primordial language. You can read and write primordial and understand all spoken dialects of primordial. You can also use minor elemental magics to speak like an air elemental.\n\nYou can move air around in the air, recreating the whooshing and whistling sounds an air elemental makes to speak the Auran dialect of primordial."
